{"id":1030101,"chapter_id":1030101,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"ナイチンゲール","content":"局長、上手くいきませんでした。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_1"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101001,"trial_step":1},{"step":2,"content":"上手くいかなかった？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101002,"trial_step":2},{"step":3,"content":"いや、待ってくれ。なんの話だ？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101003,"trial_step":3},{"step":4,"speaker":"ナイチンゲール","content":"慌てないでください、局長。それほど大事ではありません。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_4"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101004,"trial_step":4},{"step":5,"speaker":"ナイチンゲール","content":"白記事務所に関する調査が上手くいかなかったということです。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_5"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101005,"trial_step":5},{"step":6,"content":"調査員が襲われたのか？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101006,"trial_step":6},{"step":7,"speaker":"ナイチンゲール","content":"いえ、調査員に何も問題はありません。ただ白記事務所に関する調査の進捗状況があまりよろしくないというべきでしょうか。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_7"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101007,"trial_step":7},{"step":8,"content":"それは構わない。そんなに早く結果が出るとは思っていない。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101008,"trial_step":8},{"step":9,"speaker":"ナイチンゲール","content":"調査を継続するよう指示します。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_9"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101009,"trial_step":9},{"step":10,"content":"ああ。ただ、今までの調査の分も無駄にはしないでくれ。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101010,"trial_step":10},{"step":11,"content":"取調室を用意してくれ。ちょうどハク社長と話したかったところだ。","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101011,"trial_step":11},{"step":12,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"あら、来たわね。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_12"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1030101},{"step":13,"content":"気の向くまま適当な座り方をしているハクイツは、まるで自宅にいるような姿だ。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101014,"trial_step":14,"drawing":1030101},{"step":14,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"一人で来るなんて、聞かれちゃまずい話でもあるの？","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1030101},{"step":15,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1030101},{"step":16,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"もしかして照れてる？言いたいことがあるなら言ってよ。笑わないであげるから。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_16"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1030101},{"step":17,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"当然いつも通り、分毎にお金を取るわよ。もちろん喋っていない時もカウントされるから。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_17"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1030101},{"step":18,"options":["金を払う義務はない","話を逸らすな"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101019,"trial_step":19,"course":3,"drawing":1030101,"choices":[{"text":"金を払う義務はない","goto":20},{"text":"話を逸らすな","goto":21}]},{"step":19,"content":"取り調べに協力するのはコンビクトの義務だ。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1030101,"next":[22]},{"step":20,"content":"……今は取り調べをしている。まじめにやれ。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1030101},{"step":21,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"冗談よ……こんなことでお金は取らないわ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_21"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1030105},{"step":22,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"聞きたいことってなに？ほら、言ってみて。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_22"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101023,"trial_step":23,"drawing":1030105},{"step":23,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1030105},{"step":24,"content":"今日は主に「白記事務所」という会社に関して聞きたい。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1030105},{"step":25,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"白記のこと？それなら早く言えばいいのに。あたしたち白記ね、それなら……うん……","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_25"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1030101},{"step":26,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"シンジケート7日間同行ツアーなんてどう？","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_26"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1030101},{"step":27,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"今なら20％オフで、色々教えてあげるわ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_27"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1030101},{"step":28,"content":"それがあなたたちの業務なら興味深いな。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1030101},{"step":29,"content":"だが、最も重要なのは「白記事務所」という看板の後ろに隠された秘密だ。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1030101},{"step":30,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"へぇ——","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_30"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1030105},{"step":31,"content":"ハクイツは目を細め、身体を前に傾ける。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1030105},{"step":32,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"それが知りたかったの。でも、他人の秘密を知りたいなら……","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_32"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1030105},{"step":33,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"お金は取らないけど、何もないってこともないでしょう？","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_33"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1030105},{"step":34,"options":["何をして欲しい？"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101035,"trial_step":35,"course":3,"drawing":1030105,"choices":[{"text":"何をして欲しい？","goto":36}]},{"step":35,"content":"ハクイツは更に前に詰め寄り、指で胸元のQRコードを指す。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1030104},{"step":36,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"西区ストア、スペシャルディスカウント、期間限定激安価格、フレンドを呼んで更なる値引き。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_36"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1030104},{"step":37,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"こっちの最新アプリに、武器、デスラブラジオファンミチケット……商品ラインナップは粒揃い。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_37"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1030104},{"step":38,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"もう迷わないで、今すぐ2次元コードからダウンロード！","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_38"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1030104},{"step":39,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1030104},{"step":40,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"2次元コードからダウンロード！","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_40"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1030104},{"step":41,"content":"ハクイツはまた指を指す。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1030104},{"step":42,"content":"……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1030104},{"step":43,"content":"あなたはパーソナルデバイスを取り出して、その出所不明の2次元コードをスキャニングした。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1030104},{"step":44,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"はは、そうでなくちゃ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_44"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1030104},{"step":45,"content":"MBCCの回線速度は非常に速く、すでにダウンロードが完了していた。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1030101},{"step":46,"content":"音の割れた古臭い音楽と共に、色とりどりの広告が一瞬で画面を満たした。閉じようとしても閉じきれない。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1030101},{"step":47,"options":["デバイスを閉じる"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101048,"trial_step":48,"course":3,"drawing":1030101,"choices":[{"text":"デバイスを閉じる","goto":49}]},{"step":48,"content":"あなたはデバイスを閉じて、ポケットにしまった。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1030101},{"step":49,"content":"言われた通りダウンロードした。調査に協力してくれるんだろうな？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1030101},{"step":50,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"いいわ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_50"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1030101},{"step":51,"content":"ハクイツは背伸びをする。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1030101},{"step":52,"content":"まずは基本的なことから教えてくれ。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101053,"trial_step":53,"drawing":1030101},{"step":53,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"復讐から犬の散歩まで、白記事務所がお悩み解決！","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_53"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1030104},{"step":54,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"あたしたち白記の歴史は古く、さらに5年連続でシンジケートの最も人気のある業者に選ばれているの。誠実な経営で業務範囲も広く、依頼達成率も高いのよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_54"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1030104},{"step":55,"content":"私が知る限り、白記はNF105年に設立されたはずだ。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1030104},{"step":56,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"あら、分かってないわね。シンジケートでは、2年以上生きていけたら老舗なのよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_56"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1030104},{"step":57,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"コホンコホン。でね、事務所の創業初期メンバーは二人、その後三人になったの。以来チームメンバーは安定し、人員は増えていないけど、業務規模はずっと拡大しているわ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_57"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1030104},{"step":58,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"長年の下積みを経て、シンジケートの有名マフィア軍団とビジネスパートナーとしての関係も築き上げ……","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_58"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1030104},{"step":59,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"もう後は覚えきれないくらい。とにかく、白記は凄いって覚えとくといいわ。シンジケートで知らぬ者はいない。軍団でもあたしたちに手出しはできない。それどころか大人しく依頼までしてくれるのよ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_59"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1030104},{"step":60,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"これでお分かり？","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_60"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1030104},{"step":61,"content":"いや、全く分からないな——同じ白記の社員、K.K.の言っていることと完全に真逆だ。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1030104},{"step":62,"content":"＊","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":63,"content":"＊","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":64,"content":"＊","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":65,"options":["選択肢1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":66,"content":"＊","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":67,"options":["選択肢1","選択肢2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":68,"content":"＊","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":69,"content":"＊","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":63,"course":6,"drawing":1030104},{"step":70,"content":"ここでK.K.の証言を読んでみよう。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1030104},{"step":71,"content":"……つまり、ハクイツの経営はかなりまずい状況にあった。そうだな？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101065,"trial_step":65},{"step":72,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"まずいどころじゃない。壊滅的だ！","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_64"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101066,"trial_step":66},{"step":73,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"家賃は半年滞納、電気水道光熱費なんて払ったこともない。このままじゃ飯も食べられなくなる！","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_65"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101067,"trial_step":67},{"step":74,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"澈は毎日ダラダラとポーカーばかりで、たまに数日間姿が見えなくなる。ようやく帰ってきたと思ったら言い訳だらけ。仕事を任せようにも面倒くさがって結局しない。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_66"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101068,"trial_step":68},{"step":75,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"どうしろって言うんだ？私一人でやるしかないだろ。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_67"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101069,"trial_step":69},{"step":76,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"私が毎日配達の仕事と下水道掃除でようやく稼いだ金も、ハクイツの一回のやらかしでパーになる。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_68"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101070,"trial_step":70},{"step":77,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"これだから「シンジケート三害」なんて呼ばれるんだ……毎日やらかして借金を増やしてばかりで、本当に勘弁して欲しい。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_69"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101071,"trial_step":71},{"step":78,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"時々本当に絶望の一步手前に陥って、やってらんないって思うこともあるよ……","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_70"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101072,"trial_step":72},{"step":79,"content":"それほど辛いのに、どうして転職しない？","style":2,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101073,"trial_step":73},{"step":80,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"……一人は全然頼れない、もう一人は何を言われても仕事しない。飯も作れず、私がいないとインスタントラーメンしか食べない。","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_72"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101074,"trial_step":74},{"step":81,"speaker":"K.K.","content":"あの二人の恥知らず、私のことを「母さん」とまで呼ぶんだ。私がいなかったら、死ぬんじゃないか？","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_73"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101075,"trial_step":75},{"step":82,"speaker":"ハクイツ","content":"言ってくれるわね、K.K.。局長の前であたしの悪口ばかり……","voice":["vo_trial_30101_1_74"],"voice_bank":"vo_linglan_trial","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":130101076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1030106},{"step":83,"content":"意外だったな。ハク社長ともあろう人が「シンジケート三害」に数えられるとは。さ